WEBVTT

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.632
Fly, Wigasus, fly!

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.634
-[screeches]
-Go.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.548
Go and find 'em, Wigasus.

00:00:11.941 --> 00:00:13.508
That is it!

00:00:13.682 --> 00:00:16.250
You are all crazy!
And you know what?

00:00:16.424 --> 00:00:18.252
That hair's not coming back.
It escaped.

00:00:18.426 --> 00:00:20.341
Which is what we need
to be doing, Dawn,

00:00:20.515 --> 00:00:23.474
getting away from
these crazy... cave people!

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:25.128
Mom!

00:00:25.302 --> 00:00:26.913
You came barging
into our lives uninvited,

00:00:27.087 --> 00:00:30.307
without even wiping
your disgusting... feet!

00:00:30.481 --> 00:00:31.613
[whimpers]

00:00:31.787 --> 00:00:33.354
And peeping Thunk over here,

00:00:33.528 --> 00:00:35.225
with his dumb... window.

00:00:35.399 --> 00:00:36.966
Ugh. This show is
for older kids.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.403
And that flea-infested rat baby!

00:00:39.577 --> 00:00:41.144
-[confused grunt]
-You dumb baby.

00:00:41.318 --> 00:00:43.233
Okay. I'm gonna kill her.

00:00:43.407 --> 00:00:44.495
Uh, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey.
Chill.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:45.932
And you.

00:00:46.106 --> 00:00:48.064
Taking my daughter
outside the wall,

00:00:48.238 --> 00:00:49.936
giving her scars
and stupid ideas!

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:52.199
Mom! Don't talk
to my friend that way.

00:00:52.373 --> 00:00:54.418
And I'm glad
Guy came to his senses

00:00:54.592 --> 00:00:56.116
and realized he doesn't belong
with a cave girl!

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:58.205
He belongs with us,
the Bettermans!

00:00:58.379 --> 00:00:59.467
Let's go, Dawn!

00:00:59.641 --> 00:01:00.468
DAWN:
Mom!

00:01:00.642 --> 00:01:01.861
Where are you going?!

00:01:02.035 --> 00:01:04.211
Got... to get... away!

00:01:05.299 --> 00:01:07.431
Cave people!
[gasps, yelps]

00:01:07.605 --> 00:01:10.304
[shouting]

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:14.700
Oh, no.

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:16.397
[animal growling]

00:01:16.571 --> 00:01:19.139
What is that?

00:01:22.011 --> 00:01:24.448
-[gasps]
-[snarling]

00:01:24.622 --> 00:01:26.537
[growling]

00:01:26.712 --> 00:01:28.365
[shouting, grunting]

00:01:28.539 --> 00:01:29.976
-Eep!
-[grunting]

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.413
-[snarls]
-[grunting]

00:01:32.587 --> 00:01:34.154
-Get him!
-[snarling]

00:01:35.285 --> 00:01:36.765
-DAWN: Mom!
-UGGA: There she is!

00:01:36.939 --> 00:01:38.680
-[grunts]
-[yowls, whimpers]

00:01:38.854 --> 00:01:41.422
-GRAN: We're coming for you,
ice lady! -[shouting]

00:01:41.596 --> 00:01:43.990
[barking]

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.907
-[barks]
-[whimpers]

00:01:48.081 --> 00:01:49.952
[snarling]

00:01:50.997 --> 00:01:52.650
[growling]

00:01:52.825 --> 00:01:54.217
Kill circle!

00:01:54.391 --> 00:01:55.610
Come on, Stabby.

00:01:55.784 --> 00:01:57.351
Time to get stabbin'.

00:01:57.525 --> 00:02:00.136
[snarling]

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:02.878
[puppy whimpering]

00:02:03.052 --> 00:02:04.140
[yips]

00:02:04.314 --> 00:02:05.533
Guys, wait a minute.

00:02:05.707 --> 00:02:07.709
-Everyone lower your weapons.
-Dawn.

00:02:07.883 --> 00:02:09.493
What is she doing?

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:11.365
Trust her.
Lower your weapons.

00:02:11.539 --> 00:02:13.019
[snarling]

00:02:13.193 --> 00:02:14.672
[puppy whimpering]

00:02:14.847 --> 00:02:16.109
Uh, come here, little guy.

00:02:16.283 --> 00:02:17.240
You can come out.

00:02:17.414 --> 00:02:18.807
[growls softly]

00:02:18.981 --> 00:02:20.940
-Yeah. It's okay. You got it.
-[whimpering]

00:02:23.986 --> 00:02:25.858
This isn't a monster.

00:02:26.032 --> 00:02:29.078
It's a mom who was just afraid
for her baby

00:02:29.252 --> 00:02:31.341
and being protective and...

00:02:31.515 --> 00:02:34.083
maybe a bit, uh, rude.

00:02:34.257 --> 00:02:37.913
And maybe
she just didn't realize

00:02:38.087 --> 00:02:40.350
that the outsiders
weren't a threat

00:02:40.524 --> 00:02:42.222
-but actually...
-[gasps]

00:02:42.396 --> 00:02:43.876
friends.

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:46.661
And that maybe
the wolf spiders and outsiders

00:02:46.835 --> 00:02:48.881
could live
in beautiful harmony together

00:02:49.055 --> 00:02:51.231
-in their tree house!
-[wolves whimper questioningly]

00:02:51.405 --> 00:02:52.798
I mean ice cave.

00:02:53.842 --> 00:02:55.322
Whoa.

00:02:55.496 --> 00:02:58.194
You got all that
just from looking at 'em?

00:02:58.368 --> 00:03:03.243
Perhaps the window by which
I view the world is flawed.

00:03:04.244 --> 00:03:06.333
[giggles]
I'm gonna go pet 'em.

00:03:06.507 --> 00:03:07.377
-[laughing]
-[growling]

00:03:07.551 --> 00:03:08.770
Aw, look!

00:03:08.944 --> 00:03:09.989
They're hugging me
with their teeth!

00:03:10.163 --> 00:03:11.251
Ow!

00:03:15.255 --> 00:03:17.910
♪ ♪

00:03:19.737 --> 00:03:21.827
[sighs]

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:23.089
EEP:
Guy?

00:03:23.263 --> 00:03:24.264
Eep?

00:03:24.438 --> 00:03:26.440
-Guy?
-Eep, you came back!

00:03:26.614 --> 00:03:27.702
No.

00:03:27.876 --> 00:03:30.009
You made your choice.

00:03:30.183 --> 00:03:32.620
-No! That's not what I wanted!
-Enjoy your...

00:03:32.794 --> 00:03:33.708
Tomorrow.

00:03:33.882 --> 00:03:35.623
Eep, come back!

00:03:35.797 --> 00:03:38.452
No! [panting]

00:03:42.891 --> 00:03:45.459
[grunting, groaning]

00:03:47.896 --> 00:03:49.550
Grug, do you mind?

00:03:49.724 --> 00:03:52.205
I'm trying to think!

00:03:52.379 --> 00:03:54.120
Well, I'm trying
to get out of here

00:03:54.294 --> 00:03:56.122
before that monster shows up!

00:03:56.296 --> 00:03:57.732
[chomping]

00:03:57.906 --> 00:03:59.995
Oh, there's no monster,
you bonehead.

00:04:00.169 --> 00:04:03.042
They just want to... scare us.

00:04:03.216 --> 00:04:07.655
That's it. Time to strike fear
into the hearts of these apes.

00:04:07.829 --> 00:04:09.526
♪ ♪

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:10.745
[yelps]

00:04:14.749 --> 00:04:19.493
Look upon Betterman
the fire-maker and despair!

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:20.624
Flame, flame.

00:04:20.798 --> 00:04:22.670
[screeching]

00:04:22.844 --> 00:04:23.410
[chittering]

00:04:23.584 --> 00:04:24.585
Great.

00:04:24.759 --> 00:04:26.239
Now they have spears and fire.

00:04:26.413 --> 00:04:29.198
Guy, he just gave
the monkeys fire!

00:04:30.243 --> 00:04:31.113
[screeches]

00:04:31.287 --> 00:04:33.289
♪ ♪

00:04:33.463 --> 00:04:34.943
[calls]

00:04:36.031 --> 00:04:37.206
[screeches]

00:04:40.775 --> 00:04:42.385
-[panting]
-DAWN: You ready?

00:04:42.559 --> 00:04:44.387
And shake.

00:04:44.561 --> 00:04:46.868
-[grunts happily]
-Oh, oh, and shake.

00:04:47.042 --> 00:04:48.348
-[barks]
-[laughs]

00:04:48.522 --> 00:04:50.785
And shake and shake and shake
and shake and shake.

00:04:50.959 --> 00:04:53.570
Hey, Gran?
Uh, are you sure this is safe?

00:04:53.744 --> 00:04:55.833
Don't worry. It won't hurt.

00:04:56.008 --> 00:04:57.618
-Much.
-Where's Eep?

00:04:57.792 --> 00:05:00.186
She went off
to get more firewood.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.231
I'm gonna go find her.

00:05:02.405 --> 00:05:04.407
-Ugga, help me.
-[Gran shushing]

00:05:04.581 --> 00:05:06.757
-Eep?
-[Gran laughs in distance]

00:05:06.932 --> 00:05:08.803
-Eep?
-[Eep grunting fiercely]

00:05:08.977 --> 00:05:10.979
[fierce grunting continues]

00:05:15.114 --> 00:05:17.072
[gasps]

00:05:17.246 --> 00:05:18.291
[Eep grunts in frustration]

00:05:18.465 --> 00:05:20.293
[panting]

00:05:20.467 --> 00:05:21.468
[grunts fiercely]

00:05:22.512 --> 00:05:24.210
[panting]:
Oh, hey.

00:05:24.384 --> 00:05:27.517
I'm just... I'm just
getting some firewood.

00:05:30.694 --> 00:05:32.783
I think you've got it covered.

00:05:32.958 --> 00:05:36.265
You want to take a break
from beating up the forest?

00:05:38.964 --> 00:05:40.966
[Ugga grunting]

00:05:43.098 --> 00:05:45.100
Are you ready to talk about it?

00:05:46.145 --> 00:05:47.363
[Eep sighs]

00:05:50.976 --> 00:05:55.719
I can't believe
he would choose a tree over me.

00:05:55.893 --> 00:05:58.113
I don't think it's that simple.

00:05:58.287 --> 00:06:01.682
Guy knew the Bettermans
when he was little.

00:06:01.856 --> 00:06:04.728
They're the closest thing
he has to a family.

00:06:06.948 --> 00:06:10.952
Every time I've been
hurt before, I've...

00:06:11.126 --> 00:06:14.260
gotten a mark I can see.

00:06:14.434 --> 00:06:19.613
This hurts so much,
and I can't even see it.

00:06:19.787 --> 00:06:21.528
I can see it.

00:06:22.616 --> 00:06:24.922
[sniffles]
Doesn't matter.

00:06:25.097 --> 00:06:27.490
We're just too different.

00:06:27.664 --> 00:06:29.101
I don't even care.

00:06:29.275 --> 00:06:30.972
Eep.

00:06:31.146 --> 00:06:35.629
If something hurts this much,
maybe it means you do care.

00:06:35.803 --> 00:06:39.894
Maybe it's something
worth fighting for.

00:06:41.243 --> 00:06:44.290
So, what are you
gonna do about it?

